te"><addressbook><name>YAMASHINA, SHUICHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>DODO YASUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IDE KENICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MASUDA SADAKAZU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MURATA SATOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NARUSHIMA SHIGEKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMASHINA SHUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DODO, YASUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IDE, KENICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MASUDA, SADAKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MURATA, SATOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NARUSHIMA, SHIGEKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMASHINA, SHUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A plate pressing device comprising a pair of metal molds (2) disposed opposedly on the upper and lower sides of a slab (1), an oscillating device (10) which moves, symmetrically with respect to the slab, the upper and lower metal molds through an eccentric shaft or crank shaft, upper and lower bearings (21, 22) which support the rotation of the eccentric shaft or crank shaft, and a bearing moving device (24) which moves at least either of the bearings in vertical direction.  The bearing moving device (24) comprises a screw jack (27) which are installed on a main frame (26) and move a journal box (25) in vertical direction and a wedge plate (28) or a step plate (29) held between the main frame (26) and the journal box (25), thus, by using the same metal mold, enabling a plate thickness to be adjusted easily after pressing.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un dispositif de pressage de plaque comprenant une paire de moules métalliques (2) opposés l'un à l'autre en haut et en bas d'un plateau (1), un oscillateur (10) qui amène symétriquement par rapport au plateau les moules métalliques supérieur et inférieur dans un arbre excentrique ou vilebrequin, des paliers supérieur et inférieur (21, 22) qui soutiennent la rotation de l'arbre excentrique ou vilebrequin, et enfin, un dispositif de déplacement de palier (24) qui déplace au moins l'un ou l'autre des paliers dans le sens vertical. Le dispositif de déplacement de palier (24) comprend des vérins à vis (27) placés sur une structure principale (26) qui déplacent une boîte d'essieu (25) dans le sens vertical, et une plaque à coin (28) ou une plaque à gradins (29) maintenues entre la cadre principal (26) et la boîte d'essieu (25). Ainsi, en utilisant le même moule métallique, on peut facilement régler l'épaisseur d'une plaque après pressage.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence